'''First Round (Easy)''' is the first stage in [[The Proving Grounds]]. Beating this stage allows the access of two, random [[Continuation Stage]]s. The possible Continuation Stages include:
*[[2nd Round: Dawn (Normal)]]
*[[2nd Round: Dusk (Normal)]]

