==Battleground==
*2 [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*20 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage mainly spams B.B.Bunnies and Those Guys to protect the Teacher Bears and Le'boins, so [[Single Attack]] attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] are almost useless here. Instead, use powerful [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] or [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]].

